<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on Clariant.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse, Zurich say it has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Clariant AG.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    575.00 SFR		PREMIUM	11.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.05 SFR		  GEARING	9.4 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.DEC.96-12.MAR.98   PAYDATE	23.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  569.00 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
